   "rawMarkdown": "I'm using DINOv3 frozen embeddings as a backbone for my model. My issue is that the model isn't detecting small localized features like those needed for detecting ACL/MCL tears. I've tried increasing resolution and using patch tokens (not only the CLS token), but it's still having trouble detecting the features. Does anyone know how to debug this?",
   "content": "<p>I'm using DINOv3 frozen embeddings as a backbone for my model. My issue is that the model isn't detecting small localized features like those needed for detecting ACL/MCL tears. I've tried increasing resolution and using patch tokens (not only the CLS token), but it's still having trouble detecting the features. Does anyone know how to debug this?</p>",
